        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Francine McDougall, Marley Shelton, Marla Sokoloff, Mena Suvari, James Marsden, Melissa George, Everlife\n- Films: Sugar & Spice, Go Figure, Cow Belles\n- Companies: Disney Channel, Walt Disney Records\n- Topics: Disney Channel Original Movies, film direction, soundtrack releases\n\nFacts:\n- In 2001, Francine McDougall directed the American teen crime comedy film Sugar & Spice.\n- In 2001, Sugar & Spice starred Marley Shelton, Marla Sokoloff, Mena Suvari, James Marsden, and Melissa George.\n- In 2005, Go Figure was released as a Disney Channel Original Movie.\n- On June 7, 2005, Walt Disney Records released the Go Figure soundtrack featuring the title track by Everlife and a music video.\n- In 2005, Francine McDougall directed the Disney Channel Original Movie Go Figure.\n- In 2006, Francine McDougall directed the Disney Channel Original Movie Cow Belles.",
